<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>

<subsection xml:id="sec-canvas-resources">
  <title>Available Through Canvas</title>

  <p>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <p>Ask a Peer|Help a Peer Discussion Board</p>
        <p>
          <ul>
            <li>Research shows that peer-to-peer advice is valuable for learning, so we have created this forum, "Ask A Peer|Help A Peer." This is a place to ask your peers questions and share your knowledge relating to the course, topics, readings, and assignments.</li>
          </ul>
        </p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <p>Tutor.com</p>
        <p>
          <ul>
            <li>This online tutoring platform is available to all Midland College students and can be accessed via the left-hand navigation menu in your Canvas course.</li>
          </ul>
        </p>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </p>
</subsection>
